CAMERA_SOURCE   -> chi so camera (mac dinh 0) hoac duong dan RTSP/IP camera
CAMERA_WIDTH    -> do rong khung hinh mong muon (vd 1280)
CAMERA_HEIGHT   -> do cao khung hinh mong muon (vd 720)
CAMERA_FPS=15
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS -> duong dan file key service account Firebase cua edge node, dat NGOAI repo (vd C:/secrets/edge-room-a.json)
CAMERA_ROOM_201_SOURCE -> chi khi config dat camera.source_env (mac dinh null: them camera tren trang Quan ly camera cua web admin). Nguon camera cua edge node: 0 (webcam USB) hoac URL RTSP, vd rtsp://admin:matkhau@192.168.1.64:554/Streaming/Channels/101 (xem camera-ai/docs/edge_node.md)
